  "title": "Blackberry Jam Cake III",
  "description": "A very spicy cake with cinnamon, allspice and cloves. Blackberry jam is stirred in and the cakes are baked in three 9 inch pans. Make some Cream Cheese Frosting to assemble them with.",
  "authors": [
    "Jo Ann Herrington"
  ],
